[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア、そっちに行ったよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria, it went that way!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "任せて！\u3000やああっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm on it! Hyaaaah!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くっ、すばしっこいヤツね！\nミミ、お願い！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tch, it's quick! Mimi, if you would!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "言われなくたって……！\n――はああっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You don't have to tell me twice...! HAH!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わあ、やったねミミちゃん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow, that was amazing, Mimi!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふん。\nこの程度の敵、私の相手にもならないわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmph. An enemy of this level is hardly worth my time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミミさん、今の一撃お見事でした。\nさすがトトリ先輩のご友人ですね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That was an incredible strike, Miss Mimi! Miss Totori's friends are amazing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "べ、別にトトリの友達とか関係ないでしょ？\n今のは私の実力だもの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-it has nothing to do with being Totori's friend! That was purely my own ability!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うんうん、そうだよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mhm, that's right!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミミちゃんは私と一緒にいてくれるのが不思議なくらい\n強くて頼もしくて、すごい人なんだから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi's so incredibly strong and reliable, I sometimes wonder why she even sticks around with me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "不思議ってことはないんじゃない？\nだって二人とも、息ぴったりだし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't think it's such a mystery. You two are totally in sync with each other."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お互いを思いやってるのが、見てて分かるなぁ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Anyone can see how much you care about each other."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そんなことないわよ！\u3000こっちはトトリに\n振り回されて困ってるんだから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "T-that's not true at all! Totori just drags me into all sorts of trouble!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えへへ、そうだよね。ミミちゃんには\n頼ってばかりで……いつも、ごめんね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, you're right. I'm always relying on you... I'm sorry about that, okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なっ！\u3000今のは、ち、違うのよっ！\nトトリが謝ることなんてっ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wha-! N-no, that's not what I meant! You don't need to apologize for...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "トトリ先輩、そのお気持ち分かります！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I know exactly how you feel, Totori!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私もイザナちゃんに頼ってばかりで……\nもっとしっかりしなくちゃって、思うんですけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm always relying on Izana too... I keep thinking I need to do better..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えー？\u3000あたしはレスナちゃんに\n頼られるの、すっごく嬉しいけどな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whaaaat? But I love it when you rely on me, Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それだけ信頼してくれてるってことだし、\nその信頼に応えたいっていつも思うよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It means you trust me, and that just makes me want to live up to that trust even more!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナちゃん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だよね、ミミ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right, Mimi?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え、ええ、そうね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yes, I suppose..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほら！\u3000やっぱりミミも\nトトリのこと大好きなんだよー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "See! I knew it - you totally adore Totori!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ！？\u3000だ、大好き！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wha-?! A-adore?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミミちゃん……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は、その、だって……\nああ、もう！\u3000そんな目で見ないでよトトリ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I just... well, because... Oh, stop looking at me like that, Totori!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]